#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodgeometry.rst:16 9e7f7234f3ea4a76be45bd1ab87e60ca
msgid "Represents a geometry object for 3D audio occlusion calculations."
msgstr "用于 3D 声音遮挡计算的 FMOD 几何体对象"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodgeometry.rst:21 6e1aef064f2e4879a49a80ba717595a9
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodgeometry.rst:23 57b8cb46e31f4be29f72174d2781c29f
msgid ""
"FmodGeometry is used to create geometric shapes that affect 3D audio propagation in the FMOD "
"audio engine. It allows you to define polygons that act as occluders, blocking or attenuating "
"sound based on their properties."
msgstr ""
"**FmodGeometry**    封装 FMOD Geometry，用多边形描述场景中的墙体、地形、门板等遮挡物。FMOD 会根据声源与监听器之间的几何体计算直达声遮挡和混响遮挡，常用于让"
" 3D 声音在墙后变闷、变小，或减少混响发送。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodgeometry.rst:25 338e2657443443bb8c3588de0024b38d
msgid "Key features:"
msgstr "主要特性："

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodgeometry.rst:25 2af0b91755b9491eba5abcc830650da4
msgid "Create polygonal shapes that block sound paths between sources and listeners"
msgstr "创建多边形，遮挡音源与监听者之间的声音路径"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodgeometry.rst:29 c5b8147c248347f88e077bdc472c0bd9
msgid "Configure occlusion properties (direct and reverb path attenuation)"
msgstr "配置直达声和混响声的遮挡衰减"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodgeometry.rst:31 127b617b8a81457eb8807a618185bea7
msgid "Support for double-sided polygons"
msgstr "支持双面多边形"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodgeometry.rst:33 3db37b810ed54986bc163fa2ede51e9d
msgid "Position, rotate, and scale geometry in 3D space"
msgstr "在三维空间中移动、旋转和缩放几何体"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodgeometry.rst:35 f5d93b5267c04e92a0c16c9be71b98a9
msgid "Serialize geometry data for efficient loading/saving"
msgstr "序列化几何数据以便加载和保存"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodgeometry.rst:37 16e59e989c5a4eb1aed7d7e714bc5c76
msgid ""
"When a sound source is behind geometry relative to the listener, FMOD calculates occlusion values"
" that can be used to muffle the sound (direct occlusion) and reduce its reverb contribution "
"(reverb occlusion)."
msgstr "音源相对听者位于几何体背后时，FMOD 计算直达声和混响声的遮挡值，可用于减弱高频和混响贡献。"

