#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodgeometry.rst:401 0ee7ac3188394c4b93b16ff6d5435e5b
msgid ""
"Adds a polygon using the positions in ``vertices``. The array must contain at least three "
"finite vertices. ``direct_occlusion`` and ``reverb_occlusion`` are clamped to ``0.0`` through"
" ``1.0``. ``double_sided`` enables occlusion from both sides."
msgstr ""
"使用  ``vertices``  中的位置添加多边形。数组至少应包含三个有限顶点； ``direct_occlusion``  和  ``reverb_occlusion``  "
"会限制在  ``0.0``  到  ``1.0``  之间， ``double_sided``  启用双面遮挡。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodgeometry.rst:403 6b7533ee510243daaf45c48795b4c32a
msgid ""
"Returns the new polygon index, or ``-1`` on failure. Capacity is fixed by "
":ref:`FmodSystem.create_geometry()<class_FmodSystem_method_create_geometry>`."
msgstr ""
"返回新多边形的索引，失败时返回  ``-1`` 。容量由  "
":ref:`FmodSystem.create_geometry()<class_FmodSystem_method_create_geometry>`  确定。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodgeometry.rst:463 3fdc9717ddc54cd6a2367b6add2d0df7
msgid ""
"Serializes the geometry into a newly allocated :ref:`PackedByteArray<class_PackedByteArray>`."
" Load the saved data with "
":ref:`FmodSystem.load_geometry()<class_FmodSystem_method_load_geometry>`. Returns an empty "
"array on failure."
msgstr ""
"将几何体序列化到新分配的  :ref:`PackedByteArray<class_PackedByteArray>` ，可通过  "
":ref:`FmodSystem.load_geometry()<class_FmodSystem_method_load_geometry>`  加载。失败时返回空数组。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodgeometry.rst:475 fcd31b451a6b44bc9ecb12b09634fe5c
msgid ""
"Returns the serialized size in bytes, or ``0`` on failure. "
":ref:`save()<class_FmodGeometry_method_save>` allocates its output buffer automatically."
msgstr "返回序列化数据的字节数，失败时返回  ``0`` 。 :ref:`save()<class_FmodGeometry_method_save>`  会自动分配输出缓冲区。"
